  "body": "[A10] **Addendum to the ruling (maintainer, 2026-10-12).** Standing rule: where Milan v1.2's wording is ambiguous, IEEE 1722.1-2021 is the reference. Where Milan clearly differs, Milan applies. Table 5.4's observation-interval wording is ambiguous, so Table 7.159 decides FRAMES_TX (one count per AVTPDU). The ruling in [6125741685](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/726#issuecomment-6125741685) is unchanged, and the objection recorded there is withdrawn.",
